  "type": "module",
  "description": "Maktaba's Cast receiver at cast.maktaba.tv (Epic 58 story 58.07): a CAF Web Receiver page served by a Cloudflare Worker's static assets, one build per API level under /r/<level>/, picked by the loader at /r/.",
